{"id": "EUVD-2026-108685", "enisaUuid": "138a20e8-bfd2-3d81-b473-63fe60473148", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwifi: mac80211: validate deauth frame length before reason access\n\nieee80211_rx_mgmt_deauth() reads the deauth reason code before checking\nthat the fixed field is actually present in the received frame.\n\nValidate the deauth frame length first and only then read the reason\ncode.", "datePublished": "2026-10-23T11:37:51", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-23T11:37:51", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/51092dc769f021e9634474e1bd5a561da477fbdb", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a6ed4c00ccdc15011a73daa2b38af9fc5a2c543e", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/80d1a110e9096b5bf41497f6b151154084862385", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a78689e2beed200d4590318612c74ae25c9408cf", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7a5ef1fd654d0e90d59aa32c881789c8bcc4125a", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9df64ad43e1f2c036667bba2bf385e9d7b3af564", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4a360c6e18dfa9d70006c7247a6a8cc8dfe0d60f"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-98891"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1acb82a9-397c-3415-b7a3-a43a797df402", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "0 <5.10.271"}, {"id": "2fd97a75-cc18-360d-a169-d9058350c2aa", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1da177e4c3f41524e886b7f1b8a0c1fc7321cac2 <80d1a110e9096b5bf41497f6b151154084862385"}, {"id": "44e3fedd-68f9-38dd-be38-f8bf0163c2e5", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.6.158"}, {"id": "4f9c95bf-bf9a-3a9b-948a-d8a5f0b668b2", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "0 <6.18.53"}, {"id": "5877d1ad-de1a-3214-a37d-c148c9fc9f37", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1da177e4c3f41524e886b7f1b8a0c1fc7321cac2 <9df64ad43e1f2